            <div class="container-fluid">
               <div class="row no-gutters">
                  <div class="col-md-6 order-md-2 fullwidth-split-image"><img style="float: right;" title="Pay for College" src="/images/home/calculater-cap1920.jpg" alt="Calculator with mortar board"></div>
                  <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1 fullwidth-split-text">
                     <div class="text-wrapper text-right">
                        
                        <h2>Pay for College</h2>
                        
                        <h3>Is it worth it?</h3>
                        
                        <p class="lead .pb-3 pb-3">An abundance of research concludes that landing a job that pays well and provides
                           generous benefits largely depends on getting an education beyond high school.</p>
                        
                        <p class="lead .pb-3 pb-3"><a class="btn btn-default" title="Pay for College" href="/student/financial-aid/pay-for-college.html">LEARN HOW TO PAY FOR COLLEGE</a></p>
                        </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
