                  <div class="col-md-6 fullwidth-split-text">
                     <div class="text-wrapper">
                        
                        <h2>Our Campus</h2>
                        
                        <h3>Have you seen us lately?</h3>
                        
                        <p class="lead .pb-3 pb-3">With updated student housing, new facilities, and renovated classrooms, a lot has
                           happened here recently.&nbsp;</p>
                        
